  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh, Cambodia, India. The proposed project focuses on improving the overall health, nutritional status and cognitive development of children in socio-economically marginalised families in the partners&#x2019; target communities. It intends to achieve this through targeted interventions which include community-level training, awareness raising and practical skills development in areas such as nutrition-dense gardening methods, maternal and child nutrition and development, and early childcare and development (ECCD).</narrative>
  </description>
